body:
I see that this kw comes from an embl reference, AAF46730.1. 

I asked Jie where this comes from, he said that the keyword is not in the current public release, but in a private release, I guess it gets gets through to kw2GO via the private release. Jie says that the kw is in 26_01, but not in 26_02 (02 is currently scheduled for April 8 release). I don't know why it is appearing in 26_01, but I assume it is removed as part of the drosophila re-trembling, in which case it shouldn't reappear.

@sjm41
